# Review fix F2 in the editor: a state's scene that is read but does not
# load (here the Pause scene, written by "another program" on the content
# copy: an unknown component) is not created. 'Play game' faults
# ("content") as for a text that does not load; Stop returns to Edit.
write-file assets/scenes/pause.scene.json {"format":"se-scene-v1","name":"pause","entities":[{"guid":"5a4db0c5-0000-4000-8000-0000000000f3","components":{"NoSuchComponent":{}}}]}
play-game
wait-top-state title
wait-ticks 10
push-key enter
wait-frames 2
push-key enter up
wait-top-state gameplay
wait-ticks 20
push-key esc
wait-frames 2
push-key esc up
wait-frames 20
expect-faulted yes
expect-state faulted
stop
wait-frames 2
expect-state edit
expect-hash document initial
quit discard
